WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Upload data to a new review
Upload campaign data in a new review. You can choose its project after checking the analysis.

2
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Check both comparison periods
Check the current and previous periods and the outcome definition. Watch for incomplete weeks or overlapping periods.

3
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Move from summary to campaign evidence
Read the summary, then inspect campaign changes. Decomposing an observed change does not prove a causal effect.

4
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Record the action and review date
Record your action, reasoning and review date. Saving requires sign-in and active Pro or a trial.
